<title>USA: Franchise Finance lends food chain $28 mln.</title>
<headline>Franchise Finance lends food chain $28 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franchise Finance Corp of America said its FFCA Mortgage Corp unit provided about $28 million in mortgage financing for 60 Taco Bueno restaurants.</p>
<p>The restaurants are in Oklahoma and Texas, the company said.</p>
<p>Franchise Finance said it entered into the financing agreement with Casa Bonita Inc, a unit of CKE Restaurants, which owns Taco Bueno and other restaurants.</p>
</text>
